WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:05,660
That's what I told those old guys from Zhen Wuzong too.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,340
But what if you're not dead?

3
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,800
It's all your fault

4
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,480
Everyone in the world says

5
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,800
You are the first person to win out of ten

6
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,120
This time I used the Bamboo Bird Killing Star again.

7
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,760
If he hadn't died

8
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,020
Can't afford to be worthy of the name of 10 accurate and 5 wins?

9
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:25,380
By then, this title will still be useless, so use it correctly.

10
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,340
Is that kid’s name Eleven?

11
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,820
Gu Xuyi

12
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:35,310
Could it be that he really came for us?

13
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,580
It was Zhen Wuzong who asked you to come, right?

14
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,700
Isn't he the bodyguard of Lu Jian's family?

15
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,900
As long as you are alive

16
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,700
I will definitely follow you to Bai Jingcheng

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,560
I'll wait here

18
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,920
See with your own eyes whether he is dead or not.

19
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:56,770
Then I'll go back. I'm not dead. Let's be honest.

20
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,610
I have no grudges against this guy

21
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:00,170
If he can really survive

22
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:01,570
I quite admire him
